Build an online appointment booking system with hourly slots for the Medcare website (Next.js). Bookings are saved to a private Google Sheet through an Apps Script web app. The Apps Script is already written: it is at the end of this prompt. First create docs/sheets-apps-script.gs with exactly that code (copy it character for character, don't edit, reformat or lint it; it is Google Apps Script, not part of the Next.js build, so exclude docs/ from eslint/tsc if they would pick it up). Then build the website side to match its contract exactly (section 2). Only Google Sheets and Gmail (sent by the script) are used: no Telegram, no WhatsApp messaging, no Resend or other email service, no third-party booking apps.

Keep the current Medcare design: reuse the existing colours, fonts, buttons, inputs, cards, spacing and focus styles. Don't add new brand colours or a new UI library. There are no fees, no online payment, no video consults and no language switch. The booking flow sends no WhatsApp messages and has no WhatsApp buttons: the clinic gets email alerts from the Sheet and calls the patient.

